# The built documentation site. Generated by `just docs` from docs/, so keeping
# it would be a second copy of every document that can disagree with the first.
#
# Zensical's build cache needs no rule here: it writes `.cache/.gitignore`
# holding `*`, so it excludes itself.
site/
